      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;welcome-to-a-non-ergodic-blog&#34; class=&#34;header-anchor-wrapper&#34;&gt;Welcome to a non-ergodic blog!
  &lt;a href=&#34;#welcome-to-a-non-ergodic-blog&#34; class=&#34;header-anchor-link&#34;&gt;
    &lt;svg width=&#34;16px&#34; height=&#34;16px&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;
&lt;svg
    xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34;
    width=&#34;24&#34; height=&#34;24&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34;
