&lt;/svg&gt;
  &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Non-ergodic refers to ideas that are not going to be mellowed down by what is popular/good-say of a particular time period. Instead it will attempt to focus on creating Lindy ideas–that is, ideas that hold over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The old is preferred over the new. Survival is preferred over modernity. Practice is preferred over academia.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
